    "About Moonee": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ກ່ຽວກັບ Moonee"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เกี่ยวกับ Moonee"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Về Moonee"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Account": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ບັນຊີ"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "บัญชี"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tài khoản"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Added to every answer, e.g. “Keep answers under three sentences.” Numbers are always computed by the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ເພີ່ມໃສ່ທຸກຄຳຕອບ ເຊັ່ນ “ຕອບບໍ່ເກີນສາມປະໂຫຍກ.” ສ່ວນຕົວເລກແອັບຈະຄິດໄລ່ເອງສະເໝີ."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ใส่ไว้กับทุกคำตอบ เช่น “ตอบไม่เกินสามประโยค” ส่วนตัวเลขแอปจะคำนวณเองเสมอ"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thêm vào mọi câu trả lời, ví dụ “Trả lời không quá ba câu.” Số liệu luôn do app tính."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advanced": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ຂັ້ນສູງ"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ขั้นสูง"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nâng cao"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An open model (Gemma, Qwen…) you download. Private, offline, free.": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ໂມເດວແບບເປີດ (Gemma, Qwen…) ທີ່ດາວໂຫຼດລົງເຄື່ອງ. ເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ, ໃຊ້ອອບລາຍໄດ້, ຟຣີ."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "โมเดลแบบเปิด (Gemma, Qwen…) ที่ดาวน์โหลดลงเครื่อง เป็นส่วนตัว ใช้ออฟไลน์ได้ ฟรี"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Model mở (Gemma, Qwen…) tải về máy. Riêng tư, offline, miễn phí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks when Moonee opens and when you come back after this long.": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ຂໍໃຫ້ປົດລັອກເມື່ອເປີດ Moonee ແລະ ເມື່ອເຈົ້າກັບມາຫຼັງຜ່ານໄປຕາມເວລານີ້."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ขอปลดล็อกเมื่อเปิด Moonee และเมื่อคุณกลับมาหลังผ่านไปตามเวลานี้"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hỏi khi mở Moonee và khi bạn quay lại sau khoảng thời gian này."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assign categories to jars": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ຈັດໝວດໝູ່ເຂົ້າກະປຸກ"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "จัดหมวดหมู่เข้ากระปุก"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gán danh mục vào lọ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
