    "Close Moonee and open it again to switch the language.": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ປິດ Moonee ແລ້ວເປີດໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງເພື່ອປ່ຽນພາສາເດີ"
