            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tìm model"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Security": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ຄວາມປອດໄພ"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ความปลอดภัย"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bảo mật"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sent to %@: what you type to Moonee, the chat so far, and the numbers Moonee looks up to answer (totals, jar balances, matching transactions). Sent with your key, straight from this iPhone; Moonee has no server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ສົ່ງໄປຫາ %@: ສິ່ງທີ່ເຈົ້າພິມຫາ Moonee, ແຊັດກ່ອນໜ້າ ແລະ ຕົວເລກທີ່ Moonee ຊອກມາເພື່ອຕອບ (ຍອດລວມ, ຍອດເງິນໃນກະປຸກ, ລາຍການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ). ສົ່ງດ້ວຍຄີຂອງເຈົ້າ ໂດຍກົງຈາກ iPhone ເຄື່ອງນີ້; Moonee ບໍ່ມີເຊີບເວີ."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ส่งไปที่ %@: สิ่งที่คุณพิมพ์ถึง Moonee แชทก่อนหน้า และตัวเลขที่ Moonee ค้นมาเพื่อตอบ (ยอดรวม ยอดคงเหลือในกระปุก รายการที่เกี่ยวข้อง) ส่งด้วยคีย์ของคุณตรงจาก iPhone เครื่องนี้ Moonee ไม่มีเซิร์ฟเวอร์"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gửi tới %@: những gì bạn gõ cho Moonee, đoạn chat trước đó và số liệu Moonee tra để trả lời (tổng chi, số dư lọ, các giao dịch liên quan). Gửi bằng key của bạn, thẳng từ iPhone này; Moonee không có server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set a passcode on this iPhone first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ຕັ້ງລະຫັດຜ່ານໃຫ້ iPhone ເຄື່ອງນີ້ກ່ອນເດີ."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ตั้งรหัสผ่านให้ iPhone เครื่องนี้ก่อนนะ"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hãy đặt mật mã cho iPhone này trước."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up your profile": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣໄຟລ໌"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
