    "iCloud is not available right now. Your data is safe on this iPhone and syncs when iCloud is back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ຕອນນີ້ໃຊ້ iCloud ບໍ່ໄດ້. ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງເຈົ້າຍັງປອດໄພຢູ່ໃນ iPhone ເຄື່ອງນີ້ ແລະ ຈະຊິງເມື່ອ iCloud ກັບມາ."
          }
